Bundle-Name: Fennec EMF SOAP WSDL/XSD Importer
Bundle-Description: Derives Ecore from a WSDL/XSD (bootstrap/design-time), using EMF's \
 XSDEcoreBuilder plus a light WSDL operation parse. Kept separate from the SOAP runtime so \
 the runtime does not depend on the org.eclipse.xsd toolchain.

-library: enableEMF

-buildpath: \
	org.eclipse.xsd;version=latest,\
	org.eclipse.fennec.soap;version=snapshot

-testpath: \
	assertj-core;version=latest,\
	org.xmlsoap.model;version=latest
